      <activity id="44ccc64c-65c6-501f-bbe1-8b574e52c8db" activityNameId="e8a78466-008e-5412-83e9-755ba59edbf8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, medium voltage, electric utility Obwalden, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, medium voltage, electric utility Obwalden, at grid
This dataset describes the transformation from high to medium voltage as well as the transmission of electricity at medium voltage.;
UUID: aedcf71f-c18b-37ea-9795-c562114dfe36
Included are the electricity production in the electric utility Obwalden, the transmission network and direct SF6-emissions to air. Electricity losses during medium-voltage transmission and transformation from high-voltage are accounted for.
Location: Data apply to the supply area of the electric utility Obwalden.
Technology: Average technology used to transmit and distribute electricity. Includes underground and overhead lines, as well as air-, vacuum- and SF6-insulated high-to-medium voltage switching stations.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Statistical data. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_aedcf71f-c18b-37ea-9795-c562114dfe36.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
